    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class to group risk factors for atrial fribrillation related to a person's demographics. Demographics: the qualities (such as age and sex) of a specific group of people.</rdfs:comment>
